<title>RUSSIA: Russia Aug industry output falls 8.5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Russia Aug industry output falls 8.5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian industrial production rose 1.6 percent in August, but was 8.5 percent lower than a year earlier, the State Statistics Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT	AUG 96    JUL 96    AUG 95</p>
<p>    month-on-month pct change	  +1.6	+0.2	+3.5</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	    -8.5	-6.8	+0.1</p>
<p>Note - Official Russian data tend to underreport a growing private sector in the economy.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
